------Roshni Route-------

Safety-first navigation for women walking, driving, or riding alone.

The Problem

Google Maps prioritizes speed over safety — routing women through dark, deserted roads at night. Uber's SOS only works inside an Uber cab. No existing tool proactively prevents women from entering unsafe areas.

Our Solution

Roshni Route is a navigation app that routes users through well-lit, populated roads and sends automated SOS alerts — even without pressing a button.

How It Works

Safe Routing

Scans routes for 24/7 businesses (ATMs, pharmacies, police stations) as proxies for well-lit, safe roads
Users drop Black Pins on unsafe streets — the app reroutes future users around them

Automated SOS

Phone stationary in a Dark Zone for 3 minutes → 10-second countdown → SOS fires if unanswered
Phone loses network mid-route → server detects missed ping → texts family the last known location
